<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3473" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρῑβ-όω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώσω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make exact</i> or <i>accurate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				469
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τάδε</span>
			<i>to be perfect in</i> bearing these hardships, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.3.13
			</span></i>; <i>arrange precisely</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				274
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be exact</i> or <i>perfect</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1483
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠκριβῶσθαι πρὸς πᾶσαν ἀρετήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1279b1
				</span></i>
			.—Later in 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				17.2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1799.33
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>investigate accurately, understand thoroughly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τάδ᾽ ἠκριβωκότες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					1192
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.2.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὔνομά μου σὺ
			ἀκριβοῖς</span>; <i>are you sure of . .?</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Chrm.</u>
				156a
			</span></i>; <i>inquire carefully of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν χρόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					2.7
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				265.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>describe accurately</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.47
			</span></i> O. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> abs., <i>to
				be exact</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ φύσις οὐκ ἀκριβοῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					778a6
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἄνθρωπος] κατὰ τὴν ἁφὴν
					διαφερόντως ἀκριβοῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>de An.</u>
					421a22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GA</u>
					780b26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
